"开启后会在后台下载，并在你退出应用时完成安装。默认关闭，由你确认安装。" = "When enabled, updates download in the background and install when you quit. Off by default, so you confirm installation.";
"开启自动检查更新后可启用；重新开启时会保留之前的自动安装选择。" = "Available after automatic checks are enabled. Turning them back on keeps the previous automatic-install choice.";
